{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You've stayed too late playing video games, and your dad locked you up in the basement to teach you a lesson. There's a devil living inside the wall there, and it craves meat. It gives you an old sword. It's time to...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745390/extras/c4ab70d09d0501973dbb85c6d9d2a99c.poster.avif?t=1773679607\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745390/extras/c4ab70d09d0501973dbb85c6d9d2a99c.webm?t=1773679607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745390/extras/c4ab70d09d0501973dbb85c6d9d2a99c.mp4?t=1773679607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Blunt Blade and a Hundred Halls</strong> (BBaaHH for short), you will:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight, push your luck, die, respawn and go killing again</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an ever-changing dungeon with 100 chambers full of mutated freaks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill said freaks and vacuum their body parts (SPLOOOSH!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mount their heads on the cellar wall</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grind their meat in the grinder and get paid in gold</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy upgrades from the devil that lives in your basement walls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your blade sharp, because it will become battered in battle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and slot perk-granting posters based on classic comic book covers</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KILL, KILL, DIE, REPEAT NOW!</h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3745390?t=1773679607","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745390/733abadb2fdd18367bde1acd885122d38f6335f6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773679607","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745390/551cc83791342a01fef53195216a8d93cc234a49/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773679607","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745390/551cc83791342a01fef53195216a8d93cc234a49/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773679607","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Blunt Blade and a Hundred Halls is a game about slaying monsters in a dungeon to put their meat though a grinder as an offering to the devil that lives inside a basement wall. All of it looks exactly as it sounds - the game is full of violence, blood, and excessive gore. It is however presented in a stylized, boomer shooter aesthetic."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You've stayed too late playing video games, and your dad locked you up in the basement to teach you a lesson. There's a devil living inside the wall there, and it craves meat. It gives you an old sword. It's time to...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745390/extras/c4ab70d09d0501973dbb85c6d9d2a99c.poster.avif?t=1773679607\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745390/extras/c4ab70d09d0501973dbb85c6d9d2a99c.webm?t=1773679607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745390/extras/c4ab70d09d0501973dbb85c6d9d2a99c.mp4?t=1773679607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Blunt Blade and a Hundred Halls</strong> (BBaaHH for short), you will:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight, push your luck, die, respawn and go killing again</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an ever-changing dungeon with 100 chambers full of mutated freaks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill said freaks and vacuum their body parts (SPLOOOSH!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mount their heads on the cellar wall</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grind their meat in the grinder and get paid in gold</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy upgrades from the devil that lives in your basement walls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your blade sharp, because it will become battered in battle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and slot perk-granting posters based on classic comic book covers</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KILL, KILL, DIE, REPEAT NOW!</h2>","developers":["Super Duper Vibes"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745390/597e5dd226b4dbe907c5c07acd9c4468404a8dcc/header.jpg?t=1773679607","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3745390/1628584263/9c25d7c780d73653122ea84faa59f39f550ea8d0/1761670117/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761670936","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3745390/1628584263/9c25d7c780d73653122ea84faa59f39f550ea8d0/1761670117/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761670936","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3745390/1628584263/9c25d7c780d73653122ea84faa59f39f550ea8d0/1761670117/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761670936","id":257223721,"name":"Blunt Blade and a Hundred Swords - Kill, Kill, Die, Repeat","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/st